{
  "source": "Prompts/one-more-thing-1.mp4",
  "duration": 188.964,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.3,
      "text": "You type a prompt, hit Enter, and get an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.92,
      "end": 7.5,
      "text": "You type the exact same prompt again, and you get a completely different answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.1,
      "end": 8.92,
      "text": "Why does that happen?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.44,
      "end": 13.22,
      "text": "What exactly decides if the system plays it safe with a predictable response"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.22,
      "end": 15.46,
      "text": "or takes a chance on something more varied?"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.24,
      "end": 20.38,
      "text": "Finally, what is the actual physical scale of the math happening behind the scenes"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.38,
      "end": 21.78,
      "text": "to write just a single sentence?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.56,
      "end": 25.96,
      "text": "Answering these three questions strips away the last illusions of magic"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.96,
      "end": 28.3,
      "text": "and shows us exactly how the machine operates."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.3,
      "end": 33.38,
      "text": "This graphic shows probabilities for our dog naming scenario, with spot at 22."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.5,
      "end": 36.28,
      "text": "To control how often the model takes those chances,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.78,
      "end": 38.98,
      "text": "developers use a hidden setting called temperature"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.98,
      "end": 41.84,
      "text": "to manipulate the odds right before a token is drawn."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.42,
      "end": 44.76,
      "text": "This table shows how temperature changes the math."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.4,
      "end": 49.04,
      "text": "Low temperature aggressively concentrates odds onto the most likely choices,"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.42,
      "end": 51.3,
      "text": "pushing spot to 36%."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.3,
      "end": 55.1,
      "text": "High temperature flattens the odds, distributing probability downward,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.1,
      "end": 59.1,
      "text": "giving lower ranked tokens, like the other category at 39%,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.1,
      "end": 61.02,
      "text": "a much better chance of being picked."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.66,
      "end": 63.5,
      "text": "This setting dictates the shape of the draw,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.88,
      "end": 67.8,
      "text": "determining if the system prioritizes predictable stability or creative variance."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.56,
      "end": 69.94,
      "text": "Looking at these shifted percentages,"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.52,
      "end": 73.86,
      "text": "does adjusting this temperature setting change what the AI actually learned?"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.2,
      "end": 77.3,
      "text": "The answer is no."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.1,
      "end": 80.5,
      "text": "Temperature only temporarily reshapes the current draw."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.9,
      "end": 84.2,
      "text": "The massive network of fixed weights remains completely unchanged."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.2,
      "end": 88.48,
      "text": "Temperature is simply a mathematical lens placed over the model's fixed knowledge"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.48,
      "end": 89.86,
      "text": "at the very last second."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.86,
      "end": 93.52,
      "text": "While those weights stay fixed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.04,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "the AI still has to run them through a massive set of calculations"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 102.46,
      "text": "to generate every single new token."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.66,
      "end": 107.18,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down the computational cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.38,
      "end": 112.08,
      "text": "For a hypothetical model using one trillion weights,"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.08,
      "end": 118.98,
      "text": "running roughly two calculations per weight means it takes about two trillion calculations"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.98,
      "end": 120.96,
      "text": "to produce just one token."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.28,
      "end": 126.02,
      "text": "If you scale that up to a short, 100-token answer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.54,
      "end": 130.82,
      "text": "you multiply that baseline to reach 200 trillion calculations."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.32,
      "end": 134.84,
      "text": "For a longer, 1,000-token conversation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.52,
      "end": 139.4,
      "text": "the total reaches an astounding two quadrillion calculations."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.28,
      "end": 144.5,
      "text": "It is worth noting that these specific calculation estimates"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.5,
      "end": 147.78,
      "text": "apply only to the new tokens the AI writes,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.42,
      "end": 150.68,
      "text": "and they do not assume the system is repeating"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.68,
      "end": 153.5,
      "text": "all of its previous context processing from scratch."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.08,
      "end": 160.06,
      "text": "Generating even the simplest text requires a brute-force mathematical marathon."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.58,
      "end": 163.5,
      "text": "When you look past the interface,"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.06,
      "end": 165.72,
      "text": "you do not find a mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.72,
      "end": 171.4,
      "text": "You find pure math, operating at a physical scale no human can truly picture,"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.0,
      "end": 175.44,
      "text": "and all of that unfathomable math executes instantly"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.44,
      "end": 177.58,
      "text": "every single time you hit send."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.28,
      "end": 182.08,
      "text": "The conversational flow of AI is simply the result of probability,"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.7,
      "end": 185.18,
      "text": "precise tuning, and astronomical calculation."
    }
  ],
